WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.440
My administration has negotiated one historic trade

00:03.440 --> 00:06.820
deal after another, including with the United Kingdom,

00:06.820 --> 00:11.520
the European Union, Japan, South Korea, Vietnam, Indonesia,

00:11.520 --> 00:14.500
the Philippines, Malaysia, and many, many others.

